ered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           这一期是新产季豆子的一个混拼，春节后到货的第一批\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n           翡翠红标\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           ，放了2个多月了，终于可以上架了，也是第一次拿到2字头开头的采收批次，很干净的水洗，ok的～\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n           艾力达\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           的这一只是在产区时就在仓库待发的货里直接不要脸的硬抢了一箱，没想到，听今天王老师他们反馈很棒！（哦对了，翡翠的这只Leon地块的3NB日晒生豆俺们只拿到3kg，所以这就是订阅用户仅有的批次了）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n           卡马文迪\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           ，听说了3年了，今年终于买到了一些，蜜处理这只也是迄今为止买过的最贵的一只肯尼亚，也很棒！\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n           加赛茜的日晒\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           ，是处理厂第一年尝试做日晒处理，今年是我们第二年买到加赛茜的豆子，水洗一如既往的稳定，日晒两个批次也都很棒！\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           最后，\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n           ALO的水洗\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           ，第一次看到零发酵水洗的字眼，但是其实这是我这一个月来第二次接触这类的豆子了；在巴拿马时，有一天蹭Archers的杯测局，水洗组里有一只瑰夏很特别，干香气很干净的糖和柑橘的香气，喝起来非常细腻干净的柑橘，和Fred聊起来才知道这是他们特意让农场做的定制处理，就是尽量去除所有的发酵环节和机会，鲜果采收后脱皮，然后直接机械脱胶，尽可能快速的干净的去掉果胶然后去晾晒干燥；Fred也提到这个处理方式他们在埃塞做过了；然后回来后测到ALO的两个零发酵水洗批次，哈哈哈，一下子好像都又串联上了；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           这只豆子很干净，很透彻，我的感受是就好像这两年喝到的很多干净的瑰夏水洗一样，柑橘梨子果汁感，清甜，非常的容易喝耐喝好喝！\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;caret-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-in